### Obtaining the global omega estimate based on relative GTR branch lengths and nucleotide substitution biases
* Log(L) = -25455.50, AIC-c = 52453.32 (769 estimated parameters)
* 1 partition. Total tree length by partition (subs/site)  1.962
* non-synonymous/synonymous rate ratio for *test* =   0.3874

### Fitting Standard MG94
* Log(L) = -24730.88, AIC-c = 51014.15 (774 estimated parameters)
* non-synonymous/synonymous rate ratio =   0.3663
