### Fitting MG94 with double instantaneous substitutions
* Log(L) = -24711.34, AIC-c = 50977.08 (775 estimated parameters)
* non-synonymous/synonymous rate ratio =   0.3584
* rate at which 2 nucleotides are changed instantly within a single codon =   0.0339
