|               0.347               |    75.123     |                                   |
|               2.398               |    22.794     |                                   |
|               9.249               |     2.083     |                                   |


### Fitting MG94 with double and triple instantaneous substitutions
* Log(L) = -24706.40, AIC-c = 50969.21 (776 estimated parameters)
* non-synonymous/synonymous rate ratio =   0.3593
* rate at which 2 nucleotides are changed instantly within a single codon =   0.0298
* rate at which 3 nucleotides are changed instantly within a single codon =   0.0257
* rate at which 3 nucleotides are changed instantly within a single codon between synonymous codon islands =   0.0257
* The following relative rate distribution (mean 1) for site-to-site **non-synonymous** rate variation was inferred

|               Rate                | Proportion, % |               Notes               |
|-----------------------------------|---------------|-----------------------------------|
|               0.345               |    75.049     |                                   |
|               2.395               |    22.862     |                                   |
|               9.255               |     2.089     |                                   |


